cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on TigrinyaLens, please cite the project and acknowledge the original dataset and model."
title: "TigrinyaLens: Testing English-to-Tigrinya Translation Quality"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-22
authors:
  - family-names: Mebrahtom
    given-names: Amaniel
    affiliation: Kallamino Special High School
  - family-names: Girmay
    given-names: Ambassador
    affiliation: Kallamino Special High School
  - family-names: Shebabaw
    given-names: Abenezer
    affiliation: Kallamino Special High School
abstract: >-
  TigrinyaLens compares English-to-Tigrinya and English-to-French translation
  outputs from the pretrained NLLB-200 Distilled 600M model using aligned
  FLORES+ devtest examples, chrF and BLEU metrics, and a small blinded
  evaluation by native Tigrinya-speaking team members. It is an educational
  research prototype and not a certified translation service.
keywords:
  - machine translation
  - Tigrinya
  - FLORES+
  - NLLB-200
  - chrF
  - human evaluation
